	(text "Common Anode design with VCC routed into\n+ pins and - return switched to ground with\nopen drain mosfets.\n\nNo additional resistors required for 5V\noperation but 0 Ohm inserted to future proof\nagainst alternative stepper drivers and provide\ncurrent measurement during development."
